1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:01,941
Why doesn’t this bell ring just once?

2
00:00:03,650 --> 00:00:05,838
Hold the button. Current flows through the coil.

3
00:00:07,150 --> 00:00:09,747
The electromagnet pulls the armature and hammer.

4
00:00:11,150 --> 00:00:13,570
But that movement opens this tiny contact!

5
00:00:15,150 --> 00:00:17,662
The supply is cut. The magnetic pull fades.

6
00:00:19,150 --> 00:00:21,469
The spring pulls back, closing the circuit again.

7
00:00:23,150 --> 00:00:24,874
And it repeats while you hold the button.

8
00:00:27,120 --> 00:00:29,845
Not free energy. The battery powers every ring.
